toml11
------------------------------------------
toml11 is a C++11 (or later) header-only toml parser/serializer library for
C++11/14/17/20/23.

Runtime requirements:

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  doctest-2.5.3-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ToruNiina/toml11

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ToruNiina/toml11/archive/refs/tags/v4.4.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack toml11-4.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./toml11-4.4.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/toml11-4.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/toml11-4.4.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

